						<P CLASS="Texttable" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-2" STYLE="font-size:9pt;">A resolution of Nukkleus&#x2019;s stockholders may be made by written consent of the holders of a majority of the issued and outstanding shares of Nukkleus Common Stock.</FONT></P>
					</TD>
					<TD CLASS="TB" STYLE="border-bottom-width:0pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-top-width:0pt;padding-bottom:3pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;padding-top:3pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;vertical-align:top;width: 1.28%; padding: 0in 0in 3px 0in;border-width: 0pt;white-space: nowrap;" VALIGN="top">&#x00a0;</TD>
