						<P CLASS="BL_table" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;"><FONT CLASS="bullet" STYLE="font-size:10pt;">&#x2022;<FONT STYLE="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT></FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-2" STYLE="font-size:9pt;">Duty not to put himself in a position of conflict between their duty to the company and their personal interests; and</FONT></P>
						<P CLASS="BL_table" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;"><FONT CLASS="bullet" STYLE="font-size:10pt;">&#x2022;<FONT STYLE="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT></FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-2" STYLE="font-size:9pt;">Duty to exercise independent judgment.</FONT></P>
						<P CLASS="Texttable" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-2" STYLE="font-size:9pt;">In addition to the above, directors also owe a duty of care which is not fiduciary in nature. This duty has been defined as a requirement to act as &#x201c;a reasonably diligent person&#x201d; having both:</FONT></P>
						<P CLASS="BL_table" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;"><FONT CLASS="bullet" STYLE="font-size:10pt;">&#x2022;<FONT STYLE="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT></FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-2" STYLE="font-size:9pt;">the general knowledge, skill and experience that may reasonably be expected of a person carrying out the same functions as are carried out by that director in relation to the company, and</FONT></P>
						<P CLASS="BL_table" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;"><FONT CLASS="bullet" STYLE="font-size:10pt;">&#x2022;<FONT STYLE="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT></FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-2" STYLE="font-size:9pt;">the general knowledge, skill and experience that director has.</FONT></P>
					</TD>
