		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">The impact of these errors was an overstatement of total assets and total equity by approximately $2,862,000, and an overstatement of non<FONT CLASS="nobreak">-cash</FONT> investment and financing activities: common stock issued in connection with acquisition of approximately $2,003,000 for the nine&#x00a0;months ended June&#x00a0;30, 2021. These errors did not have any impact on consolidated operating loss, net loss or earnings per share. The Company&#x2019;s June&#x00a0;30, 2021 financial statements have been restated for the impact of these adjustments as follows:</P>
