		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-15" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:72pt;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(i)&#x00a0;<FONT STYLE="width: 30px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>The SPAC shall have delivered a fairness opinion of The Benchmark Company LLC or such other financial advisory firm designated by the SPAC, in form and substance reasonably satisfactory to the Company.</FONT></P>
